Input: {"text": "Required. String. The text to be analyzed for sentiment."}
Output: {"score": "Float. The sentiment score of the text."}

2. Name: extractEntities
Description: This function extracts named entities from a given text and returns a list of entities with their corresponding labels.
Input: {"text": "Required. String. The text to be analyzed for named entities."}
Output: {"entities": "List of dictionaries. Each dictionary contains the 'text' of the entity and its corresponding 'label'."}

3. Name: classifyText
Description: This function classifies a given text into one or more categories based on a pre-trained model and returns a list of categories with their corresponding scores.
Input: {"text": "Required. String. The text to be classified.", "model": "Optional. String. The name of the pre-trained model to use for classification. Default is 'textcat'."}
Output: {"categories": "List of dictionaries. Each dictionary contains the 'label' of the category and its corresponding 'score'."}

4. Name: summarizeText
Description: This function summarizes a given text into a shorter version and returns the summary.
Input: {"text": "Required. String. The text to be summarized.", "max_length": "Optional. Integer. The maximum length of the summary. Default is 100."}
Output: {"summary": "String. The summarized version of the text."}

5. Name: translateText
Description: This function translates a given text from one language to another and returns the translated text.
Input: {"text": "Required. String. The text to be translated.", "source_lang": "Required. String. The language code of the source text.", "target_lang": "Required. String. The language code of the target language."}
Output: {"translated_text": "String. The translated version of the text."}

6. Name: listModels
Description: This function lists all the pre-trained models available for use in the API.
Input: None
Output: {"models": "List of strings. Each string is the name of a pre-trained model available for use."}

