NLDocumentation:
getDataSet: Retrieves a specific data set from the Victoria State Government Open Government API.
Parameters: {"dataSetId": "Required. string. The ID of the data set to retrieve."}
Output: The requested data set, including all available data and metadata.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: #DataSet
getGeoData: Retrieves geo-location based data from the Victoria State Government Open Government API.
Parameters: {"latitude": "Required. number. The latitude of the location to retrieve data for.", "longitude": "Required. number. The longitude of the location to retrieve data for."}
Output: All available data and metadata for the location specified, including any relevant data sets and geospatial information.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: #GeoData
searchDataSet: Searches for data sets in the Victoria State Government Open Government API based on specified criteria.
Parameters: {"query": "string. A search query to filter data sets by name or description.", "category": "string. A category to filter data sets by.", "tags": "Array[string].  Tags to filter data sets by."}
Output: A list of data sets that match the specified search criteria, including all available metadata.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Array[#DataSet]
listCategories: Retrieves a list of all available categories in the Victoria State Government Open Government API.
Parameters: {}
Output: A list of all available categories, including their names and descriptions.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Array[#Category]
listTags: Retrieves a list of all available tags in the Victoria State Government Open Government API.
Parameters: {}
Output: A list of all available tags, including their names and descriptions.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Array[#Tag]
getMetadata: Retrieves metadata about a specific data set in the Victoria State Government Open Government API.
Parameters: {"dataSetId": "Required. string. The ID of the data set to retrieve metadata for."}
Output: Metadata about the specified data set, including its name, description, category, tags, and availability.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: #Metadata

The detailed output format for the tools is outlined below:
#DataSet: Object{id, name, description, category, tags: Array[string], data: Object, metadata: Object}
#GeoData: Object{latitude, longitude, dataSets: Array[Object{id, name, description, category, tags: Array[string], data: Object, metadata: Object}], geospatialData: Object}
#Category: Object{name, description}
#Tag: Object{name, description}
#Metadata: Object{id, name, description, category, tags: Array[string], availability}

