Parameters: {"q": "Required. string. The search query.", "type": "Required. string. One of: [cloudcasts, users, tags]. The type of search to perform."}
Output: Search results retrieved successfully.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{results_count, results: Array[Object{type, cloudcast: Object{name, url, description, tags: Array[string], created_time, audio_length, pictures: Object{large, medium, small}, user: Object{name, username, url}, play_count, favorite_count, repost_count, comment_count}, user: Object{name, username, url}, tag: Object{name, url}}]}

Function_Description.getCloudcast:
Retrieve detailed information about a specific Mixcloud cloudcast
Parameters: {"username": "Required. string. The username of the Mixcloud user who uploaded the cloudcast.", "cloudcast_slug": "Required. string. The slug of the cloudcast."}
Output: Cloudcast information retrieved successfully.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{name, url, description, tags: Array[string], created_time, audio_length, pictures: Object{large, medium, small}, user: Object{name, username, url}, play_count, favorite_count, repost_count, comment_count}

