search: Search for specific texts or passages within texts
Parameters: {"query": "Required. string. The search query.", "author": "string. The author of the text.", "title": "string. The title of the text.", "passage": "string. The specific passage within the text to search for.", "limit": "integer. The maximum number of results to return. Default is 10."}
Output: An array of search results.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Array[Object{title, author, passage, url}]
getText: Retrieve an entire text or specific passages within a text
Parameters: {"id": "Required. string. The ID of the text to retrieve.", "start": "integer. The starting character position of the passage to retrieve. Default is 0.", "end": "integer. The ending character position of the passage to retrieve. Default is the end of the text."}
Output: A JSON object representing the text or passage.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{title, author, text, url}
translate: Automatic machine translation of texts to English, French, and German
Parameters: {"text": "string.", "target": "string. One of: [en, fr, de]."}
Output: A JSON object representing the translated text.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{text, source, target}
getMarkup: Access texts with additional markup information, such as annotations and commentary
Parameters: {"id": "Required. string. The ID of the text to retrieve.", "start": "integer. The starting character position of the passage to retrieve. Default is 0.", "end": "integer. The ending character position of the passage to retrieve. Default is the end of the text."}
Output: A JSON object representing the text or passage with markup.
 - Format: application/json
 - Structure: Object{title, author, text, url}

